{
  "slug": "mstr-bitcoin-v2",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts",
  "voiceName": "Iapetus",
  "style": null,
  "batch": 20,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/01-hook.wav",
      "sec": 4.015,
      "text": "Strategy 這家軟體公司，怎麼握有全球四趴的比特幣？",
      "hash": "ccdb58867216",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-strategy",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/02-what-is-strategy.wav",
      "sec": 4.727,
      "text": "它的美股代號是 M S T R，二零二零年起就一直在買比特幣。",
      "hash": "55fd7e3bc5c8",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "stock-vs-coin",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/03-stock-vs-coin.wav",
      "sec": 5.087,
      "text": "股價跟幣價連動但更猛，十一月五號盤中幣跌六趴，它跌一成。",
      "hash": "a3fce65a8749",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "funding-tools",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/04-funding-tools.wav",
      "sec": 5.153,
      "text": "買幣的錢來自三種工具：增發股票、可轉債和永續優先股。",
      "hash": "81ebba0deb70",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-mnav",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/05-what-is-mnav.wav",
      "sec": 4.845,
      "text": "M N A V 是市值除以持幣價值，大於一就代表有溢價。",
      "hash": "31b87e76334f",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "flywheel",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/06-flywheel.wav",
      "sec": 4.396,
      "text": "以前的玩法像飛輪：溢價時發股買幣，每股含幣變多。",
      "hash": "938aa79c3ac6",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "premium-math",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/07-premium-math.wav",
      "sec": 4.934,
      "text": "溢價兩倍時，發十股買二十枚，每股含幣從一枚升到一點零九枚。",
      "hash": "69ad3a25cb73",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "saylor-logic",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/08-saylor-logic.wav",
      "sec": 4.613,
      "text": "共同創辦人看的是每股含幣，才會說「我會永遠買在頂部」。",
      "hash": "2ca8c7c102e4",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "premium-gone",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/09-premium-gone.wav",
      "sec": 4.83,
      "text": "但二零二六年溢價幾乎歸零，股價差不多只等於手上的幣。",
      "hash": "2a45c2f86dd1",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "money-flow-2026",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/10-money-flow-2026.wav",
      "sec": 4.407,
      "text": "今年募到兩百一十二億美元，六成多買幣，其餘多回購優先股。",
      "hash": "724b1a46c9fd",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "btc-yield-negative",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/11-btc-yield-negative.wav",
      "sec": 5.104,
      "text": "幣多了二十六趴，股數多了三十一趴，每股含幣反而少三點七趴。",
      "hash": "ebb4eb1c48ed",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "never-sell-to-selling",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/12-never-sell-to-selling.wav",
      "sec": 3.904,
      "text": "說過「不是賣家」的公司，今年五月起賣幣付股息。",
      "hash": "a8accd484043",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "risks",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/13-risks.wav",
      "sec": 5.006,
      "text": "風險有兩個：幣價貼近成本線，指數會不會剔除它還沒定。",
      "hash": "2b21700f9240",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/14-summary.wav",
      "sec": 5.299,
      "text": "一句話：有溢價就發股買幣，沒溢價飛輪就停，還得賣幣付息。",
      "hash": "e9970590287e",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/15-end.wav",
      "sec": 2.161,
      "text": "白話國際，一支講透一件事。",
      "hash": "d738f4982828",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    }
  ]
}